{"unit_id":"dd2673__dsh-cross-session-agent#feature-1","repo":"dd2673/dsh-cross-session-agent","commit":"f0f7c3d6ab66c66f19472ae33220bad4613724d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session-agent 的功能「发现协作会话」：列出未归档的非子代理会话及其标题、工作目录和运行状态，在线会话排在前面。Agent 调用 list_peer_agents 获取列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:318-374"]}
{"unit_id":"dd2673__dsh-cross-session-agent#feature-2","repo":"dd2673/dsh-cross-session-agent","commit":"f0f7c3d6ab66c66f19472ae33220bad4613724d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session-agent 的功能「发送协调消息」：将文本投递给指定会话，可选 followup、inject 或 steer；离线目标会恢复后接收。Agent 调用 send_agent_message 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:376-489"]}
{"unit_id":"dd2673__dsh-cross-session-agent#feature-3","repo":"dd2673/dsh-cross-session-agent","commit":"f0f7c3d6ab66c66f19472ae33220bad4613724d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session-agent 的功能「查询回执」：按消息 ID 查看 pending、claimed、discarded 或 unknown 状态，也可列出发送记录。调用 check_delivery 查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:491-535"]}
{"unit_id":"dd2673__dsh-cross-session-agent#feature-4","repo":"dd2673/dsh-cross-session-agent","commit":"f0f7c3d6ab66c66f19472ae33220bad4613724d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-session-agent 的功能「读取 peer 有限上下文」：查看同一工作目录会话的对话文本、活动摘要或概览，输出限量并按 UTF-8 字节截断。Agent 调用 get_peer_context 选择视图和消息数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:146-162","lib/index.js:183-239","lib/peer-context.js:69-103","lib/peer-context.js:116-162"]}
